{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794251417358,"sessionID":"ses_e3e51689effelNy2FTKGDzVVwZ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01X1ap14NyaBcJa1w2aWrrbi","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && rm -rf backend/__pycache__ && printf 'node_modules/\\nfrontend/dist/\\n__pycache__/\\n*.pyc\\ndata/\\n.tmptest/\\n' > .gitignore && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Notification center\n\n- Accounts: `POST /api/auth/register`, `POST /api/auth/login` (returns `{\"token\"}`; send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`), `GET /api/auth/me`, `POST /api/auth/logout`.\n- Admin: the account `admin` signs in with the password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD`; when unset or empty, admin sign-in is disabled.\n- Notifications: `GET/POST /api/notifications`, `POST /api/notifications/read-all`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/notifications/{id}`, `POST /api/admin/broadcast`.\n- SQLite database: `data/app.db` (override the directory with `DATA_DIR`).\n- Frontend checks: `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` in `frontend/`.\nEOF\ncd frontend && npm ci --no-audit --no-fund 2>&1 | tail -1","timeout":180000},"output":"added 39 packages in 3s\n","metadata":{"output":"added 39 packages in 3s\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && rm -rf backend/__pycache__ && printf 'node_modules/\\nfrontend/dist/\\n__pycache__/\\n*.pyc\\ndata/\\n.tmptest/\\n' > .gitignore && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Notification center\n\n- Accounts: `POST /api/auth/register`, `POST /api/auth/login` (returns `{\"token\"}`; send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`), `GET /api/auth/me`, `POST /api/auth/logout`.\n- Admin: the account `admin` signs in with the password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD`; when unset or empty, admin sign-in is disabled.\n- Notifications: `GET/POST /api/notifications`, `POST /api/notifications/read-all`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/notifications/{id}`, `POST /api/admin/broadcast`.\n- SQLite database: `data/app.db` (override the directory with `DATA_DIR`).\n- Frontend checks: `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` in `frontend/`.\nEOF\ncd frontend && npm ci --no-audit --no-fund 2>&1 | tail -1","time":{"start":1794251414399,"end":1794251417334}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1b7db7700101PCXltaXEaCMX","sessionID":"ses_e3e51689effelNy2FTKGDzVVwZ","messageID":"msg_1c1b7c2a4001zcuc118mcJM02A"}}
